1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,880
 become more like him.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:05,280
 Second, when we understand God's love for us

3
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:07,200
 and for the rest of his children,

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,840
 we become immune to the divisive and misleading labels

5
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:13,320
 of our fallen world, both the labels

6
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:16,080
 that people try to put on us and the labels

7
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:18,800
 the world puts on others.

8
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,120
 We see ourselves in all of God's children

9
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,800
 as beloved and divine.

10
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:26,120
 We become quick to repent, slow to judge,

11
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:30,160
 and ever hopeful that the best is yet before us.

12
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:33,000
 We are forever willing to love and to make sure

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
 that no one is ever sitting, standing, or walking alone.

14
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,440
 Third, understanding our Father's love

15
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,400
 protects us from the pernicious lie

